  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive)</p>\n<p><em>Banned from any Casino with half a brain, this upgrade to Kiroshi’s flagship optics uses pseudo-AI upscaling — pre-approved by Netwatch — to provide better clarity for close-up observation.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Image Enhance Cyberware Enhancement.</strong> This enhancement applies to two different installations of Image Enhance in separate Cybereyes when purchased. While within 12m/yds of an item or target the user is attempting to visually perceive, they gain an additional +1 bonus to Perception, Lip Reading, or Conceal/Reveal Object Checks to do so.</p>\n<p><strong>Enhances:</strong> Image Enhance<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Cyberoptics).</em></p>"
